 talent","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery/td-lh-org-talent.md","line":42},{"title":"using Leader Hub","target":"td-lh-using","line":48},{"title":"Installing and configuring Leader Hub","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery/td-lh-install-config.md","line":50},{"title":"Using Leader Hub","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery/td-lh-using.md","line":51},{"title":"Leader Hub reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery/td-lh-reference.md","line":52},{"title":"Leader Hub","target":"td-lh-landing","line":56},{"title":"Using Leader Hub","target":"td-lh-using","line":57}],"metadata":{"title":"Exploring Leader Hub","description":"The Leader Hub app provides organizational and HR leaders with visibility into their organization's talent so they can comprehensively understand the landscape of their workforce. This application helps leaders gauge their team's strengths and deficiencies to confirm their employees have the appropriate skills and expertise to succeed in the present and future.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery/td-lh-explore.html","release":"australia","product":"HR Service Delivery","classification":"hr-service-delivery","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":2,"breadcrumb":["Leader Hub","HR Service Delivery","Employee Service Management"],"tags":["#employee-service-management","#hrsd","#hr","#cases","#service-catalog","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/employee-service-management/hr-service-